    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEd Dempsey & Associates are delighted to present this pristine fully furnished and newly renovated one-bedroom top floor apartment superbly positioned opposite from The Four Courts. \n\nInternally the accommodation comprises an entrance hall, open plan living/dining room, kitchen featuring all mod-cons, double bedroom with fitted wardrobe and a luxury appointed bathroom. Of particular note there is a communal roof garden for residents. \n\nNo. 6 Usher Quay is a modern private development of superior quality apartments located within easy access of Temple Bar, O Connell Street, Grafton Street and the City Centre in general. Of note, the property is well served by public transport and has an excellent bus service on the doorstep. The property has a wide choice of local amenities and facilities in the area including speciality shops, cafes and fashionable eateries."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Fully refurbished one-bedroom apartment</li><li> Brand new kitchen featuring all mod cons</li><li> Comfortable living area with brand new sofa and views of River Liffey</li><li> Double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and brand-new double bed</li><li> Luxury appointed bathroom</li><li> Quiet modern development</li><li> Convenient to a host of amenities and facilities</ul>"
